{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5jMbbuwJh4pxwNdeNGz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MATERIAL OBJECTION\n\n## (1) Fidelity to the four overlap points\n\n| # | Point | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Access labels | **Applied faithfully.** Model-processed fetches and snippets count as relayed sources. The added rule \"가공 여부를 알 수 없으면 가공된 것으로 본다\" is part of the definition and adds no duty. |\n| 2 | Credit transcription and scope test | **Applied with a material distortion.** The scope test (§5, including research-path claims) is faithful. The credit-row line has two problems, covered below. |\n| 3 | Gaps | **Applied faithfully.** The re-check happens before writing and adds no text. The justification duty is limited to gaps raised to ④. A relayed lead is recorded as \"미확인 단서\". |\n| 4 | Compression | **Applied faithfully.** Repeated gaps and access limits are recorded once and referenced (§8). Identical columns become a one-line legend (§9). |\n\n**The two problems in point 2:**\n\n> `점검표나 근거 부록에 이름이 있는 크레딧 행(…)을 옮길 때는`\n\n\"이름이 있는\" means \"named in the checklist or appendix\", not \"copied into it\". A producer can read this as covering any row named there, wherever it gets copied, including body prose. The narrow scope that was meant to prevent length growth is therefore not clearly stated.\n\n> `일부만 옮기면 선별 전사라고 밝히고 빠진 역할의 종류를 적는다.`\n\nThe overlap requires declaring **what** a selective copy omits. This line only asks for the omitted role types. A producer can drop one co-writer from a role it keeps and still comply. Dropping people within a row was the most frequent D6 defect in round 1, so this wording permits the main failure the point was meant to stop.\n\n**Replacement (whole line):**\n\n> 부클릿·유통사·판매처 페이지 등 출처를 밝힌 크레딧 행을 점검표나 근거 부록에 옮길 때는 대상 트랙에 대해 그 행의 인물과 역할을 모두 옮긴다. 일부만 옮기면 선별 전사라고 밝히고 빠진 역할의 종류를 적는다. 선별은 역할 단위로만 한다. 옮기는 역할은 그 역할을 맡은 인물을 모두, 함께 맡은 것으로 옮긴다.\n\nThis keeps the recording duty the same size: it still lists omitted role types only. It closes the gap by defining selection as whole roles only.\n\n## (2) Scope creep and album-specific content\n\n- **None found.** The examples (부클릿·유통사·판매처) are generic. No album, outlet, service or fact is named.\n- The diff correctly leaves out the items that were not in the overlap: Claude's location rule and gate-label rule, and Astra's N/A and evaluability rule.\n\n## (3) New defects\n\n- **Contradictions:** none. The new definition of 원문 확인 sits next to the unchanged P0 line about what 원문 확인 means, and the two agree. The legend rule does not conflict with \"모든 트랙을 점검표에 올린다\": rows stay and only identical columns are removed.\n- **Headless feasibility:** the producer can follow every rule. \"Unknown means processed\" settles the case where the tool's behaviour isn't documented.\n- **Check before freezing (not an objection):** confirm that '검색 결과 경유' and '미확인 단서' are already in P0's status list. If they aren't, the diff creates new labels and needs one alias sentence.\n- **Length risk (not an objection):** a ④ gap now records both the received material checked and the unchanged P0 \"실패 이유와 인계 방법\". That could duplicate reasons, but ④ is capped at 3, so the cost is bounded.\n\nOut of scope: none."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7618,"cache_read_input_tokens":1807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7618},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0709ff2d-7962-4d4d-80cd-9dade8fb10cf","uuid":"3ba8b995-1c2c-4864-a817-e5abc04fd7d0","timestamp":"2026-10-16T10:08:36.052Z","request_id":"req_011Cg5jMbG62P5BAU2qZT8we"}
